                  "text": "3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Malaika okundi, owaba ne sibuumba sie sahabu sie khurakho bie khukhwosia biiunya kumuuya kumulayi lukali, echa mala eema a alutare atakatifu. Aebwa biiunya kumuuya kumulayi bikali, khutasa khu lisaba lie babaandu ba Wele boosi, mala abiiane khu alutare eye sahabu eyaba ebweeni we Ndebe eye bubwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne liliisi lie biiunya kumuuya kumulayi lianiina alala ne lisaba lie babaandu ba Wele khukhwama mukhono mwa malaika owimile ebweeni wa Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
